"{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the Aeroplan economy award departing late on January 15 and arriving in Bangkok at 9:50 a.m. on January 17: among the shown choices, it has the shortest reported elapsed time and arrives 45 minutes before the other late-departing Aeroplan option. The tradeoff is that its quoted taxes are only part of the award cost, and its legs’ individual cabins aren’t specified.\"}]}]}"
